# kw-set-se: Does se s {a=7}, a prefix of set, change the parameter a (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: 5
# pc: ODE0019
# ruling: A set only adds a named parameter set to the GUI, so no headless output shows whether the keyword was read, and even a broken set body loads (kw-set-malformed).
x'=0
x(0)=3
par a=5
aux v=a
se s {a=7}
@ total=0,dt=1
